items.long_description:
1. Utilizes the most advanced Stable Diffusion XL model to ensure high-quality image output;
2. The default generated images are at a resolution of 1024*1024, with support for 1:1, 3:4, and 4:3 aspect ratios;
3. Supports a variety of specially tuned image generation models, including realistic, animate, 3D animate, and others;
4. Images are generated using the state-of-the-art 4090 graphics card, with server cluster support to ensure rapid production quality;
5. The history of all generated images is saved for 7 days;
6. Specially designed image generation interface to help users have a good experience.
